{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;No one remains...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/8e8982cbcbe09201e1551d08cf031274.poster.avif?t=1772004179\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/8e8982cbcbe09201e1551d08cf031274.webm?t=1772004179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/8e8982cbcbe09201e1551d08cf031274.mp4?t=1772004179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a car crash, Sam wakes up confused in an empty hospital... or at least, that's what it seems. The hallways are now roamed by strange creatures... tall, twisted figures, made of flesh and blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only sounds left in this desolate world are the grunts of these creatures and the metalic echo of an emergency broadcast, that constantly repeats itself announcing a safe place located in the mall. Holding on to any kind of hope, Sam must go through dark and infested halls, meanwhile these creatures hunt her down\u00a0retlenlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you, alongside Sam be able to escape this nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/80f70f06b6252fd57241c0a374561104.poster.avif?t=1772004179\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/80f70f06b6252fd57241c0a374561104.webm?t=1772004179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/80f70f06b6252fd57241c0a374561104.mp4?t=1772004179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of a city now desolated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a world full of unknown creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS1 style graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay inspired by 5th gen survival horror classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies will stop at nothing to kill you...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/49fc1bbc960622b3b51eaa02a0e1fc17.poster.avif?t=1772004179\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/49fc1bbc960622b3b51eaa02a0e1fc17.webm?t=1772004179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/extras/49fc1bbc960622b3b51eaa02a0e1fc17.mp4?t=1772004179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077680?t=1772004179","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/af1b75f0828de92f82df1b6360beab358d7846a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772004179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/20475a677dabf592ac3f29ca8294f6b8783fa22c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772004179","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077680/20475a677dabf592ac3f29ca8294f6b8783fa22c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772004179","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There are imagery of gore and